{"root":"geli","ipa":"/ɡəli/","core":"形容身体部位因被触碰而产生的一种生理性发痒或不适感，引申为对某事感到恶心、反感或滑稽可笑。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡəli/","zh":"发痒的；恶心的；滑稽的","phrases":[{"t":"rasa geli","zh":"感到发痒；感到恶心"},{"t":"tertawa geli","zh":"因觉得好笑而大笑"},{"t":"geli hati","zh":"觉得好笑；忍俊不禁"}],"examples":[{"t":"Jangan geli-geli di telapak kaki saya.","zh":"别挠我的脚心，我会痒。"},{"t":"Saya merasa geli melihat tingkah lakunya yang aneh.","zh":"看到他那奇怪的行为，我觉得很滑稽。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"geli","ipa":"/ɡəli/","zh":"发痒的；恶心的","phrase":{"t":"geli melihatnya","zh":"看了觉得恶心"},"example":{"t":"Dia geli melihat cacing itu.","zh":"他看到那条虫子觉得很恶心。"}},{"w":"menggelikan","ipa":"/məŋɡəlikan/","zh":"令人发痒的；令人发笑的；令人作呕的","phrase":{"t":"cerita menggelikan","zh":"令人发笑的故事"},"example":{"t":"Film itu sangat menggelikan.","zh":"那部电影非常滑稽可笑。"}},{"w":"kegelian","ipa":"/kəɡəli-an/","zh":"发痒感；恶心感","phrase":{"t":"menahan kegelian","zh":"忍住笑意"},"example":{"t":"Dia tidak bisa menahan kegelian saat digelitik.","zh":"被挠痒时他无法忍住那种发痒的感觉。"}},{"w":"menggelitik","ipa":"/məŋɡəlitik/","zh":"挠痒；逗乐","phrase":{"t":"menggelitik perut","zh":"逗得人捧腹大笑"},"example":{"t":"Ayah suka menggelitik adik.","zh":"爸爸喜欢挠弟弟的痒。"}}],"derSlugs":["geli","menggelikan","kegelian","menggelitik"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:32:57.318Z","src":"base"}